      "id": "COMMON_MESSAGE_401",
      "message_ID": 401,
      "file_path": "/COMMON/MESFILE.DK4",
      "speaker": "Crew member selected by original voice",
      "context": "One of eight alternative warnings in the same rat infestation. The speaker reports the immediate threat. The eight choices are different voices, and only one speaks in a given incident.",
      "source_meaning": "The rats have proliferated and will ruin the food if nothing changes.",
      "localization_note": "Keep the scale of the infestation, the future condition and both complete phrases about the food.",
